{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TH","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"帖撒羅尼迦前書","commonName":"帖撒羅尼迦前書","title":"帖撒羅尼迦前書","order":52,"numberOfChapters":5,"sha256":"29881629b06ca3a5c4aa25d7c5fc025cbcd7c1b00dc61155c04f262a6cdf9c73","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":5,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TH/5.json","totalNumberOfVerses":89},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我們既不能再忍，就願意獨自等在雅典，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["打發我們的兄弟在基督福音上作上帝執事的",{"noteId":0},"提摩太前去，堅固你們，並在你們所信的道上勸慰你們，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["免得有人被諸般患難搖動。因為你們自己知道，我們受患難原是命定的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我們在你們那裏的時候，預先告訴你們，我們必受患難，以後果然應驗了，你們也知道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["為此，我既不能再忍，就打發人去，要曉得你們的信心如何，恐怕那誘惑人的到底誘惑了你們，叫我們的勞苦歸於徒然。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["但提摩太剛才從你們那裏回來，將你們信心和愛心的好消息報給我們，又說你們常常記念我們，切切地想見我們，如同我們想見你們一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["所以，弟兄們，我們在一切困苦患難之中，因着你們的信心就得了安慰。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["你們若靠主站立得穩，我們就活了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我們在上帝面前，因着你們甚是喜樂；為這一切喜樂，可用何等的感謝為你們報答上帝呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我們晝夜切切地祈求，要見你們的面，補滿你們信心的不足。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["願上帝－我們的父和我們的主耶穌一直引領我們到你們那裏去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["又願主叫你們彼此相愛的心，並愛眾人的心都能增長，充足，如同我們愛你們一樣，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["好使你們當我們主耶穌同他眾聖徒來的時候，在我們父上帝面前，心裏堅固，成為聖潔，無可責備。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"作上帝執事的：有古卷是與上帝同工的","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TH/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TH/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1TH/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}